# Class declaration appearing AFTER a function that uses its constraint in the same dict.
# Pass 0c pre-registers class/instance declarations before the SCC loop, so MyClass
# is visible when use-it's annotation is resolved even though MyClass is declared later.
[
  use-it: [fn@[return: a constraint: [a: MyClass]] [x@a] x]
  MyClass: [class [MyClass a]]
  MyClassInt: [instance MyClass [pattern [Int]]:]
  result: [use-it 42]
]

---

%.result
=== out
Int(42)
